This is 99% Invisible. I'm Roman Mars. Nearly a decade ago, I had this thought that at the end of the year, it would be nice to tell a few little stories. We call them mini stories. Many stories maybe don't rise a level of being a fully reported story, and often there's something silly or interesting that was on the producer's mind. Maybe it's an outtake from a reported episode. Maybe it's something completely new. Many stories were a way to have some fun at the end of the year, and for the staff to take a proper vacation. That was how it all started.
这里是 99% Invisible。我是罗曼·马尔斯（Roman Mars）。大约十年前，我曾萌生过这样一个想法：如果在年底时，能讲几个短短的故事，那该多好。我们把它们叫做迷你故事。许多迷你故事或许还够不上被深度报道的级别，而且通常是制作人脑子里觉得有些荒诞或有趣的想法。也许它是某个报道过的单集里的未采用片段，也许它是个全新出炉的内容。迷你故事是年底时自娱自乐的一种方式，也是让全体员工能真正休个假的好机会。一切就是这样开始的。

